    {
      "path": "guide/install.md",
      "title": "安装",
      "html": "<h1 id=\"安装\">安装</h1>\n<h2 id=\"系统要求\">系统要求</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Go 1.22 及以上</li>\n<li>目标平台：Linux / macOS / Windows</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"构建\">构建</h2>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__head\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"codeblock__copy\" data-copy><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>复制</span></button></div><pre><code class=\"language-bash\">go build -o docsite ./cmd/server</code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"运行\">运行</h2>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__head\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"codeblock__copy\" data-copy><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>复制</span></button></div><pre><code class=\"language-bash\">./docsite -addr :8080</code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"从源码运行-开发\">从源码运行（开发）</h2>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__head\"><span>bash</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"codeblock__copy\" data-copy><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>复制</span></button></div><pre><code class=\"language-bash\">go run ./cmd/server -addr :3000</code></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li>开发时可直接用任意静态服务器托管 <code>web/</code>，API 指向本服务</li>\n<li>生产建议直接运行单二进制</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"任务清单\">任务清单</h2>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled checked><span>验证 <code>GET /api/config</code> 返回站点配置</span></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled checked><span>验证 <code>GET /api/menu</code> 返回菜单树</span></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled><span>配置反向代理（可选）</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
