    {
      "path": "guide/deep.md",
      "title": "深度示例",
      "html": "<h1 id=\"深度示例\">深度示例</h1>\n<p>这是一篇用于演示<strong>三级菜单</strong>的文档。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h2>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__head\"><span>go</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"codeblock__copy\" data-copy><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><span>复制</span></button></div><pre><code class=\"language-go\">package main\n\nimport (\n\t&quot;fmt&quot;\n\t&quot;net/http&quot;\n)\n\nfunc main() {\n\thttp.HandleFunc(&quot;/hello&quot;, func(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\n\t\tfmt.Fprintln(w, &quot;hello from go&quot;)\n\t})\n\thttp.ListenAndServe(&quot;:8080&quot;, nil)\n}</code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"任务列表\">任务列表</h2>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled checked><span>支持三级菜单</span></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled checked><span>选中高亮</span></li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled><span>快捷键导航（规划中）</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"引用\">引用</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>简洁是最终的完美。\n—— 列奥纳多·达·芬奇</p>\n</blockquote>\n",
